flowchart TD
    FORK["process fork (cold start only)"] --> APP["Application.onCreate (keep MINIMAL)"]
    APP --> ESSENTIAL["essential init only: DI, crash reporting"]
    APP -.->|defer| LATER["non-essential SDKs: analytics, ads - after first frame"]
    ESSENTIAL --> ACT["first Activity onCreate + setContent"]
    ACT --> FRAME["first frame drawn (TTID)"]
    FRAME --> CACHE["render cached / skeleton (Ch 12/34)"]
    CACHE --> RFD["content ready -> reportFullyDrawn (TTFMC)"]
    CACHE -.->|background| FRESH["fetch fresh, update (Ch 29)"]
    STARTUP["Jetpack App Startup: ordered, lazy Initializers"] --> APP
    BP["Baseline Profile: AOT-compile hot paths"] -.-> FORK
